# Actor kind $22 (Kind22Start $83:9CD2, Kind22Wait 9CE2, Kind22Second
# 9CDE), which no play reaches: stage a1 s1 places one at x $0876,
# y $02A0. With the view put at x $07F6, y $0220 and Aladdin at x $0876,
# y $0280, it is created (record $0BAB) and stays, its wait run each
# frame; 60 frames on its record is put in state $8C, so the loop runs its
# second-state entry (ActorEndPlaced).
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a1_s1.state
wait 30
poke 001773 F6,07
poke 0019E5 F6,07
poke 001777 20,02
poke 0019E9 20,02
poke 0008E7 76,08
poke 0008EA 80,02
wait 60
poke 000BAB 8C
wait 20
